  "body": "## What's New\n\nThis is a maintenance release that moves to `circular-buffer` 2.x, picking up a memory-safety fix in 2.0.1. It also refreshes the install docs.\n\n### Fixes\n- Bump `circular-buffer` to 2.0.1 (#237)\n\n### Maintenance\n- Update `circular-buffer` from v1 to v2 (#234)\n- Feature the install script and fix stale install links in the README (#228)\n- Pin release workflow actions to immutable SHAs (#230)\n- Group and throttle GitHub Actions dependabot updates (#231)\n- Bump `actions/checkout` from 6.0.2 to 6.0.3 (#233)\n\n## Contributors\n* Ben Beasley @musicinmybrain\n* Jose Fernandez @jfernandez\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jfernandez/bpftop/compare/v0.9.0...v0.9.1",
